{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Opaque"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no cryptography in this enum, or anywhere in this package. That is deliberate and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what §23.1 requires: OPAQUE needs an oblivious PRF, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hash_to_curve"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expand_message_xmd"},{"type":"text","text":", an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"envelope construction and a three-message AKE, and eleven independent implementations of that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is eleven chances to be subtly and silently wrong. The SRP-6a this replaces was arithmetic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every language can express — which here meant a hand-written big-integer modular exponentiation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pbkdf2_sha256"},{"type":"text","text":"-only limitation on top, because Swift has no Argon2 that ships on every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supported platform."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/available()","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/startLogin(password:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Opaque\/startRegistration(password:)"],"title":"Type Methods"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Entry points into ","type":"text"},{"code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §23).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/opaque"